Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:19:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Rename FencedDdl to EpochCheckedDdl and state that it
 only detects

An epoch check before and after a drop or rename detects a stale schema
operation but cannot prevent it: a drop delayed between the checks still
runs. Nothing should present it as a fence.
